From c8dedc3e4f26297acca7beae1eabd59bd8943bae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerege Systems Development Team <dev@gerege.mn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 10:03:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat(platform): persist module state and add runtime
 enable/disable admin API

Phase 3 lifecycle: migration 52 adds platform_modules (state only - the
manifest catalog stays in code, so stale rows are warnings, never boot
failures). New platform usecase wires registry rules -> DB persistence ->
best-effort audit. Admin surface:

  GET /api/v1/platform/admin/modules      detailed list (RequireAdmin)
  PUT /api/v1/platform/admin/modules/{id} toggle without restart

Disabled state is restored on boot (lenient fixed-point over dependency
order). Swagger regenerated; golden inventory +2 admin routes.
